OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,FMore than 2,500 properties still have
OL,7,Fno or low water pressure in Tonbridge
OL,8,Ffollowing a major burst water main on
OL,9,FShipbourne Road.
OL,11,FSouth East Water is continuing
OL,12,Femergency repairs following the
OL,13,Frupture which happened at 7:15am on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
