CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785833290
OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,FWater supplies have so far been
OL,7,Frestored to more than 5,000 homes, but
OL,8,Fthe company says reduced water levels
OL,9,Fin local storage tanks have impacted
OL,10,Fthe booster pumps serving 322
OL,11,Fproperties on higher ground in
OL,12,FBidborough.
OL,14,FEngineers worked through the night but
OL,15,Fsay the repairs have been made more
OL,16,Fcomplex due to equipment failure and
OL,17,Fthe presence of high-voltage
OL,18,Felectrical cables near the burst main.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
