PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785833290
OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,FSouth East Water's Incident Manager,
OL,7,FRob Hall, said: "I am very sorry to
OL,8,Fall our customers in Tonbridge and
OL,9,FBidborough who are experiencing low
OL,10,Fpressure or no water.
OL,12,F"I fully understand how frustrating
OL,13,Fthis ongoing disruption is, and I want
OL,14,Fto reassure the community that our
OL,15,Fteams are working as quickly and
OL,16,Fsafely as possible to fix the pipe and
OL,17,Frestore supplies.
OL,26,@oD@QOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
