OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785833290
OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,F"To support residents while work is
OL,7,Funderway, we have opened bottled water
OL,8,Fstations and are delivering water
OL,9,Fdirectly to affected households who
OL,10,Fare on our Priority Services Register."
OL,12,FThe two bottled water stations in
OL,13,FTonbridge are open again today at:
OL,15,FLocal residents have spoken of their
OL,16,Ffrustration at the ongoing issues and
OL,17,Fwhat they say is the lack of adequate
OL,18,Fresponse.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@gO]
