PN,38905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785833290
OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,FMark Bown told us that his 99-year-old
OL,7,Fmother-in-law has been without water
OL,8,Fsince Saturday morning.
OL,10,FShe has had water delivered but is too
OL,11,Ffrail to lift the bottles or use them
OL,12,Fto top up her empty toilet cistern.
OL,14,FHe told us she is reliant on
OL,15,Fneighbours to help her but worries
OL,16,Fabout other elderly people in a
OL,17,Fsimilar situation.
OL,19,FSEW has come under fire in recent
OL,20,Fmonths after multiple water supply
OL,21,Ffailures in Kent and Sussex.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
