PN,38906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785833290
OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,FSome 24,000 SEW customers had no water
OL,7,Fsupply or low pressure between
OL,8,FNovember and December - just weeks
OL,9,Flater up to 30,000 households faced
OL,10,Fdays of water misery.
OL,12,FTwo weeks ago, thousands of people
OL,13,Fwere without water in Tunbridge Wells
OL,14,Fbecause of technical problems at a
OL,15,Fwater treatment plant.
OL,17,FLocal MP Tom Tugendhat posted on
OL,18,Fsocial media that he had spent
OL,19,FSaturday helping at a bottle station
OL,20,Falongside the new Chief Executive of
OL,21,FSouth East Water John Halsall.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
