CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785833290
OL,3,CThousands still without water after
OL,4,Cmains pipe burst in Kent
OL,6,FMr Halsall took over as chief
OL,7,Fexecutive in July after the departure
OL,8,Fof under-fire boss David Hinton.
OL,10,FMr Tugendhat said: "A welcome change
OL,11,Fin leadership, now we need a change in
OL,12,Fservice."
OL,14,FCustomers can keep up-to-date via the
OL,15,Fcompany's website: southeastwater.co.uk
OL,26,@rD@TOUtD@IO]
